nh gửi thiệp mời luôn nè, bấm tham gia là đăng ký được ảnh nha</p>\n</div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-[11px] text-[#151821]/40 mb-4\" data-kid=\"3-2-7\">14:23</p>\n\n    <div class=\"flex justify-start mb-4\" data-name=\"event invite card\" data-kid=\"3-2-8\">\n      <div class=\"w-[340px] bg-white border-2 border-[#151821] rounded-lg overflow-hidden\" data-kid=\"3-2-8-1\">\n        <div class=\"bg-[#FF2E93] px-4 py-2 flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"3-2-8-1-1\"><i data-lucide=\"calendar-days\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-white\" data-kid=\"3-2-8-1-1-1\"></i><span class=\"text-[11px] font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide\" data-kid=\"3-2-8-1-1-2\">Thiệp mời sự kiện</span></div>\n        <div class=\"p-4\" data-kid=\"3-2-8-1-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-bold text-[17px] text-[#151821] mb-2\" data-kid=\"3-2-8-1-2-1\">Hội chợ CLB</p>\n          <p class=\"text-[13px] text-[#151821]/60 flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-1\" data-kid=\"3-2-8-1-2-2\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" data-kid=\"3-2-8-1-2-2-1\"></i>Thứ 6 · 14:00</p>\n          <p class=\"text-[13px] text-[#151821]/60 flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-4\" data-kid=\"3-2-8-1-2-3\"><i data-lucide=\"map-pin\" class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" data-kid=\"3-2-8-1-2-3-1\"></i>Sân trường</p>\n          <button class=\"w-full py-2.5 rounded-md bg-[#D4FF3F] text-[#151821] font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-bold text-[13px] border-2 border-[#151821]\" data-name=\"tham gia event button\" data-kid=\"3-2-8-1-2-4\">Tham gia</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"flex justify-end mb-1\" data-name=\"outgoing message 2\" data-kid=\"3-2-9\">\n      <div class=\"max-w-[70%] bg-[#D4FF3F] border-2 border-[#151821] rounded-2xl rounded-br-sm px-4 py-2.5\" data-kid=\"3-2-9-1\"><p class=\"text-[14px] text-[#151821] font-medium\" data-kid=\"3-2-9-1-1\">Tham gia rồi nha, hẹn gặp thứ 6! 🎸</p>\n</div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-[11px] text-[#151821]/40 text-right\" data-kid=\"3-2-10\">14:25</p>\n  </main>\n\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 px-16 py-5 border-t-2 border-[#151821] bg-[#F7F5EF]\" data-name=\"message input bar\" data-kid=\"3-3\">\n    <button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-[#151821] bg-white flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\" data-kid=\"3-3-1\"><i data-lucide=\"plus\" class=\"w-4.5 h-4.5 text-[#151821]\" data-kid=\"3-3-1-1\"></i></button>\n    <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Nhắn tin...\" class=\"flex-1 px-4 py-3 rounded-md border-2 border-[#151821] bg-white text-[14px] text-[#151821] outline-none placeholder:text-[#151821]/40\" data-kid=\"3-3-2\">\n    <button class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-full border-2 border-[#151821] bg-[#D4FF3F] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\" data-kid=\"3-3-3\"><i data-lucide=\"send\" class=\"w-4.5 h-4.5 text-[#151821]\" data-kid=\"3-3-3-1\"></i></button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<script>lucide.createIcons();</script>",
