span>\n      <h1 class=\"font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-bold text-[28px] text-[#151821] mb-5\" data-kid=\"3-2-1-3\">Hội chợ CLB</h1>\n\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6 mb-6\" data-name=\"event meta row\" data-kid=\"3-2-1-4\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[#151821]\" data-kid=\"3-2-1-4-1\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" class=\"w-4.5 h-4.5\" data-kid=\"3-2-1-4-1-1\"></i><span class=\"text-[14px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"3-2-1-4-1-2\">Thứ 6, 14:00 – 17:00</span></div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[#151821]\" data-kid=\"3-2-1-4-2\"><i data-lucide=\"map-pin\" class=\"w-4.5 h-4.5\" data-kid=\"3-2-1-4-2-1\"></i><span class=\"text-[14px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"3-2-1-4-2-2\">Sân trường</span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"text-[15px] text-[#151821]/70 leading-relaxed mb-7\" data-name=\"event description\" data-kid=\"3-2-1-5\">Các CLB cùng nhau dựng gian hàng giới thiệu hoạt động, trò chơi và mini game có quà. Đăng ký trước để nhận vé ưu tiên vào cửa!</p>\n\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 bg-white border-2 border-[#151821] rounded-lg p-4 mb-7\" data-name=\"attendees row\" data-kid=\"3-2-1-6\">\n        <div class=\"flex -space-x-3\" data-kid=\"3-2-1-6-1\">\n          <div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-full border-2 border-white bg-[#D4FF3F] flex items-center justify-center\" data-kid=\"3-2-1-6-1-1\"><i data-lucide=\"gamepad-2\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-[#151821]\" data-kid=\"3-2-1-6-1-1-1\"></i></div>\n          <div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-full border-2 border-white bg-[#FF2E93] flex items-center justify-center\" data-kid=\"3-2-1-6-1-2\"><i data-lucide=\"paintbrush\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-white\" data-kid=\"3-2-1-6-1-2-1\"></i></div>\n          <div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-full border-2 border-white bg-[#2FF3E0] flex items-center justify-center\" data-kid=\"3-2-1-6-1-3\"><i data-lucide=\"music\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-[#151821]\" data-kid=\"3-2-1-6-1-3-1\"></i></div>\n          <div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-full bo