kid=\"3-2-2-1-1-2\">Nháp</span>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"text-[13px] text-[#151821]/40\" data-kid=\"3-2-2-1-2\">0 đăng ký</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"text-[13px] text-[#151821]/50 mb-4\" data-kid=\"3-2-2-2\">Chưa có giờ/địa điểm cụ thể</p>\n      <div class=\"flex gap-2\" data-kid=\"3-2-2-3\">\n        <button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-md border-2 border-[#151821] bg-white text-[#151821] text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"3-2-2-3-1\">Sửa</button>\n        <button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-md border-2 border-[#151821] bg-[#D4FF3F] text-[#151821] text-[13px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"3-2-2-3-2\">Đăng công khai</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bg-white border-2 border-[#151821] rounded-lg p-5 mb-4\" data-name=\"event row public\" data-kid=\"3-2-3\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\" data-kid=\"3-2-3-1\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"3-2-3-1-1\">\n          <p class=\"font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-bold text-[16px] text-[#151821]\" data-kid=\"3-2-3-1-1-1\">Đêm nhạc acoustic</p>\n          <span class=\"bg-[#D4FF3F] border-2 border-[#151821] text-[#151821] text-[11px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full uppercase\" data-kid=\"3-2-3-1-1-2\">Công khai</span>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"text-[13px] text-[#151821]/50 font-semibold\" data-kid=\"3-2-3-1-2\">38 đăng ký</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"text-[13px] text-[#151821]/50 mb-4\" data-kid=\"3-2-3-2\">Chủ nhật · 19:00 · Hội trường</p>\n      <div class=\"flex gap-2\" data-kid=\"3-2-3-3\">\n        <button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-md border-2 border-[#151821] bg-white text-[#151821] text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"3-2-3-3-1\">Sửa</button>\n        <button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-md border-2 border-[#151821] bg-white text-[#151821] text-[13px] font-semibold flex items-center gap-1.5\" data-kid=\"3-2-3-3-2\"><i data-lucide=\"users\" class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" data-kid=\"3-2-3-3-2-1\"></i>Xem danh sách</button>\n        <button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-md border-2 border-[#FF2E93] bg-white text-[#FF2E93] text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"3-2-3-3-3\">Huỷ</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bg-[#151821]/5 border-2 border-[#151821]/15 rounded-lg p-5\" data-name=\"event row cancelled\" data-kid=\"3-2-4\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\" data-kid=\"3-2-4-1\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"3-2-4-1-1\">\n          <p class=\"font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-bold text-[16px] text-[#151821]/50 line-through\" data-kid=\"3-2-4-1-1-1\">Giao lưu CLB tháng 8</p>\n          <span class=\"border-2 border-[#151821]/20 text-[#151821]/40 text-[11px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full uppercase\" data-kid=\"3-2-4-1-1-2\">Đã huỷ</span>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"text-[13px] text-[#151821]/35\" data-kid=\"3-2-4-1-2\">12 đăng ký (đã đóng)</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n</div>\n<script>lucide.createIcons();</script>",
